# EtoroIcon Component - Agent Guide

## Overview

The `EtoroIcon` component is a comprehensive React Native icon system that provides theme-aware, accessible, and customizable icons for the eToro application. It integrates with hooks for theme handling and accessibility features.

## Component Location

- Main component: [`et-icon.tsx`](./et-icon.tsx)
- Tests: [`et-icon.test.tsx`](./et-icon.test.tsx)
- Types: [`api/types.ts`](./api/types.ts)

## Key Features

- Theme-aware icon rendering with automatic color selection
- Accessibility support with configurable labels and roles
- Fill support for compatible icons
- Size variants (xs, sm, md, lg, xl, 2xl) and custom numeric sizes
- Advanced SVG properties support
- Comprehensive test coverage

## Usage Examples

### Basic Usage

```tsx
import { EtoroIcon } from 'etoro-ui';

// Minimal setup
<EtoroIcon
  icon={{ iconName: 'home' }}
  accessibility={{ testID: 'home-icon' }}
/>

// With size and color
<EtoroIcon
  icon={{ iconName: 'search' }}
  appearance={{ size: 'lg', color: '#FF0000' }}
  accessibility={{ testID: 'search-icon' }}
/>
```

### Advanced Usage

```tsx
// With fill support
<EtoroIcon
  icon={{ iconName: 'heart' }}
  style={{ hasFill: true, fill: '#FF6B6B' }}
  accessibility={{
    testID: 'heart-icon',
    accessibilityLabel: 'Favorite',
    accessibilityRole: 'button'
  }}
/>

// With custom styling and SVG props
<EtoroIcon
  icon={{ iconName: 'settings' }}
  appearance={{ size: 32 }}
  style={{ style: { padding: 8, backgroundColor: '#F0F0F0' } }}
  advanced={{ svgProps: { strokeWidth: 2, opacity: 0.8 } }}
  accessibility={{ testID: 'settings-icon' }}
/>
```

## Available Icon Names

- `home`, `search`, `user`, `settings`, `heart`, `plus`, `minus`
- `apple`, `btc`, `gainers`, `losers`, `torii`, `notification`

## Available Sizes

- Predefined: `'xs' | 'sm' | 'md' | 'lg' | 'xl' | '2xl'`
- Custom: Any number (pixels)
- Default: `'md'`

## Props Interface

```tsx
interface EtoroIconProps {
  icon: {
    iconName: IconName;
  };
  appearance?: {
    size?: IconSize;
    color?: string;
  };
  style?: {
    hasFill?: boolean;
    fill?: string;
    style?: ViewStyle | ViewStyle[];
  };
  accessibility?: {
    testID?: string;
    accessibilityLabel?: string;
    accessibilityRole?: AccessibilityRole;
  };
  advanced?: {
    svgProps?: Record<string, any>;
    cache?: boolean;
  };
}
```

